{"title":"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If each of the three operation signs, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/9/459e71005de2bd793bd33a20f48e315600a5a162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{--}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 4px\" width=\"8\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/c/bac4dbe1c696d11e8dc43dd7f613199b2120daa1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\times$\" width=\"11\" height=\"9\" />, is used exactly ONCE in one of the blanks in the expression\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/7/1b7edb634a838d5aef8ed25f0ed51e7578a227e2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5\\hspace{1 mm}\\underline{\\hspace{4 mm}}\\hspace{1 mm}4\\hspace{1 mm}\\underline{\\hspace{4 mm}}\\hspace{1 mm}6\\hspace{1 mm}\\underline{\\hspace{4 mm}}\\hspace{1 mm}3\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>then the value of the result could equal\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/e/7deb8ebcc6c961d32cd7f2da1ae2688ed4c696a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 9 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 16 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are a reasonable number of ways to place the operation signs, so guess and check to find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/c/85cf01864db458a210a3e7249944ef98434b294f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5-4+6 \\times 3 = \\boxed{\\text{(E)}\\ 19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"187\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME\" title=\"1993 AJHSME\">1993 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Pr